add('figure-01',2,[614,83,1090,921],'Single-particle CdS absorption with and without NaCl','Absorption spectra at 30 min and 48 h for CdS in chelate polymer particles of approximately 100 µm diameter.','Sample a: no added NaCl; sample b: nominal source label 0.5 M NaCl. Panels are different reaction-time specimens, not a single spectrum.',panels=['a: 30 min','b: 48 h'],notes=['The nominal 0.5 M label is preserved. The procedure states 10 mL of 0.5 M NaCl followed by 100 mL Na2S solution; postmix concentration basis is unresolved.','Approximately 100 µm is the swollen polymer-particle diameter, not the CdS nanocrystal diameter.','No digitized spectrum or inferred optical onset is created.'])
