add('figure-06',5,[614,84,1090,1072],'Optical CdS-layer boundary and source schematic','Original optical micrograph of a sample a hybrid bead and schematic defining the radial CdS layer width L.','Sample a. Panel a is an optical image; panel b is the authors’ interpretive diagram.',evidence='experimental_optical_image_and_source_schematic',panels=['a: optical micrograph with 25 µm bar','b: schematic polymer particle and layer-width L definition'],notes=['Panel b is not a measured concentration map, an atomic model or a crystalline polymer structure.','L measures from the outer polymer surface to the ring boundary; it is not the CdS crystallite diameter.','No nanocrystals were observed in the central region of sample a; exact coordinate map is not provided.'])
