add('equation-03',7,[182,1173,577,1243],'Donnan potential as a function of fixed charge and electrolyte','Displayed equation 3 combines concentration and neutrality assumptions.','Model calculation for the source polymer/electrolyte comparison.',kind='equation',evidence='theoretical_model',notes=['Δφ=−RT/F ln[X/(2C)+sqrt(1+(X/(2C))²)], preserved without numerical recomputation.','A literal C=0 is singular; the paper’s finite no-added-NaCl estimate requires a nonzero external ionic concentration not fully specified in that comparison.','Source quotes −390 and −10 mV, and prints −26 meV for a hypothetical reduced-swelling case. Preserve the unit inconsistency instead of silently treating meV as mV.'])
